{"blocks":[["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-1860","2. Stay on the edge between the two",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\""]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-1900","Mind as Digestive System",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\""]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-1998","3.1 30-Day Information Audit",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\""]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2036","Log daily time (or pages/episodes) for each medium (social, YouTube, streaming, reading, podcasts…)",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\"","3.1 30-Day Information Audit"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2143","Add a daily \"Collins score\" (–2 to +2 subjective quality)",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\"","3.1 30-Day Information Audit"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2208","After 30 days sort/scan for patterns → design an Information Consumption Plan that maximises +2 days and minimises –2 days",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\"","3.1 30-Day Information Audit"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2344","Run a 30-Day Info-Audit",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\"","3.1 30-Day Information Audit"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2442","Template explanation",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","3. Information Hygiene – \"Mind = Digestive System\"","3.1 30-Day Information Audit"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2537","4. Slayable Dragons – Goal-Setting After Jordan Peterson",["Deep Questions – Episode 373"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2607","1. Have a vision for each life-bucket (health, work, relationships…). A short narrative of what \"good\" looks like",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","4. Slayable Dragons – Goal-Setting After Jordan Peterson"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2731","2. Pick one \"next goal\" that moves closer to the vision; it must be challenging yet clearly attainable (a \"slayable dragon\")",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","4. Slayable Dragons – Goal-Setting After Jordan Peterson"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-2866","3. Work on only one-to-two next goals at a time to avoid log-jams. Finish, then choose the next dragon",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","4. Slayable Dragons – Goal-Setting After Jordan Peterson"]]],"format_version":5}